6)\n35072: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4072038 \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5507-2103\")\n35073: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4072038 \"2025-09-10T09:47:23Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n35074: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_4072038 \"ILX:0770157\")\n35075: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4072038 \"L5 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35076: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:inSubset obo:CL_4072038 cl:cellxgene_subset)\n35077: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.11165918\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4072038 \"The marker set ARSJ, RORB, KCNK2 can identify the Human cell type L5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron in the neocortex with a confidence of 0.764261336 (NS-Forest FBeta value).\")\n35078: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072038 \"L5 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens)\")\n35079: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 obo:CL_4030064)\n35080: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_9606))\n35081: SubClassOf(obo:CL_4072038 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0015004 obo:CLM_1000068))\n35082: \n35083: # Class: obo:CL_4072039 (L4 intratelencephalic projecting glutamatergic neuron (Homo sapiens))\n35084: \n35085: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000028 obo:CL_4072039 \"L4 IT (Homo sapiens)\")\n35086: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37292694\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37824655\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/e/c3aa4f95-7a18-4a7d-8dd8-ca324d714363.cxg/\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4072039 \"A transcriptomically distinct intratelencephalic-projecting glutamatergic neuron with a soma found in cortical layer 3-4. This neuron type can have a pyramidal, star-pyramidal or spiny stellate morphology and projects its output to L2/3 and L5A/B. The standard transcriptomic 