{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978095625,"sessionID":"ses_1cca60250ffek6SmYva89G0cg9","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"webfetch","callID":"call_4gKINzr58e2IrhE8rYbKXJQt","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"url":"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/ols4/api/search?q=fibrocartilage&ontology=uberon","format":"text","timeout":60},"output":"{\"response\":{\"docs\":[{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001995\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0001995\",\"description\":[\"The white fibrocartilages admit of arrangement into four groups-interarticular, connecting, circumferential, and stratiform -- WP. EDITOR NOTE: TODO add mineralized\",\"Cartilage tissue intermediate between hyaline cartilage and dense connective tissue; contains of abundant collagen fibers; chondrocytes often arranged in columns.\"],\"label\":\"fibrocartilage\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0001995\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"fibrocartilage tissue\",\"stratified cartilage tissue\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0009013\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0009013\",\"description\":[\"Fibrocartilage in which strong bundles of white fibrous tissue predominate.\"],\"label\":\"white fibrocartilage\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0009013\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0034712\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0034712\",\"description\":[\"Fibrocartilage containing bundles of yellow elastic fibers but with little or no white fibrous tissue.\"],\"label\":\"yellow fibrocartilage\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0034712\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0035847\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0035847\",\"description\":[\"fibrocartilaginous entheses attach to bone through a transitional layer of fibrocartilage from the fibrous tendon tissue the sites where tendons or ligaments insert into the bone\"],\"label\":\"fibrocartilage enthesis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0035847\",\"type\":\"class\"},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0016619\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0016619\",\"description\":[\"A Y-shaped fibrocartilage structure that lies in the substance of the muscular ventral pouch of rorqual whales.\"],\"label\":\"Y-shaped fibrocartilage skeleton of ventral pouch\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0016619\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"YSFS\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0016628\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0016628\",\"description\":[],\"label\":\"stem of Y-shaped fibrocartilage skeleton of ventral pouch\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0016628\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"YSF stem\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0016629\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0016629\",\"description\":[],\"label\":\"branch of Y-shaped fibrocartilage skeleton of ventral pouch\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0016629\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"YSF branch\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0001066\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"intervertebral fibrocartilage\",\"spinal disk\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0001066\",\"description\":[\"whose gel-like core is nucleus puloposus, by this definition only in mammals\",\"A pad of fibrocartilage between the articular surfaces of two successive vertebral centra which has nucleus pulposus at its core.\"],\"label\":\"intervertebral disk\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0001066\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"intervertebral disc\",\"discus intervertebralis\",\"spinal disc\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4072104\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"related_synonyms\":[\"FC\"],\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"CL_4072104\",\"description\":[\"A chondrocyte with hybrid fibroblastic-chondrogenic characteristics found in fibrocartilage, particularly in the avascular inner zone and transitional middle zone of the meniscus. In humans, fibrochondrocytes are marked by predominant expression of type I collagen (COL1A1) and fibril-associated collagens (COL3A1, COL6A1), while retaining type II collagen (COL2A1) expression and exhibiting lower SOX9 than hyaline chondrocytes. This molecular profile underlies the synthesis of abundant type I collagen essential for fibrocartilage matrix and reflects an intermediate phenotype between fibroblast and chondrocyte.\"],\"narrow_synonyms\":[\"meniscus fibrochondrocyte\"],\"label\":\"fibrochondrocyte\",\"obo_id\":\"CL:4072104\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"fibrocartilage chondrocyte\"]},{\"iri\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0002216\",\"ontology_name\":\"uberon\",\"ontology_prefix\":\"UBERON\",\"short_form\":\"UBERON_0002216\",\"description\":[\"Cartilaginous joint in which the articulating bones or cartilages are connected by fibrocartilage. Examples: pubic symphysis, intervertebral symphysis, manubriosternal joint.[FMA].\"],\"label\":\"symphysis\",\"obo_id\":\"UBERON:0002216\",\"type\":\"class\",\"exact_synonyms\":[\"secondary cartilaginous joint\"]}],\"numFound\":23,\"start\":0},\"responseHeader\":{\"QTime\":149,\"status\":0},\"facet_counts\":{\"facet_fields\":{\"ontologyPreferredPrefix\":[\"UBERON\",\"23\",\"ADDICTO\",\"0\",\"ADO\",\"0\",\"AEO\",\"0\",\"AFO\",\"0\",\"AGRO\",\"0\",\"AISM\",\"0\",\"AMPHX\",\"0\",\"APO\",\"0\",\"APOLLO_SV\",\"0\",\"ARO\",\"0\",\"AfPO\",\"0\",\"BAO\",\"0\",\"BCIO\",\"0\",\"BCO\",\"0\",\"BFO\",\"0\",\"BMONT\",\"0\",\"BSPO\",\"0\",\"BTO\",\"0\",\"CAO\",\"0\",\"CARO\",\"0\",\"CCF\",\"0\",\"CCO\",\"0\",\"CDAO\",\"0\",\"CDNO\",\"0\",\"CHEBI\",\"0\",\"CHEMINF\",\"0\",\"CHIRO\",\"0\",\"CHMO\",\"0\",\"CIDO\",\"0\",\"CIO\",\"0\",\"CL\",\"0\",\"CLAO\",\"